{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54860","headline":"兵要望江南 占兽第二十（京本列第二十二，前六首另作「占牛马第十八」○三十四首） 七 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占兽第二十（京本列第二十二，前六首另作「占牛马第十八」○三十四首） 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"城营内，生产两头奇。\n或有足多生八只，四足两头祸不移，裂土应逾期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54860.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54860","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}